en the parent fills in total months and years\u002Fmonths that conflict, total months win; when only years\u002Fmonths are filled in, they are summed again and carried over.",[341,348,349,350,353,354,357],{},"An empty side counts as 0; when both are empty, all three bindings are ",[295,351,352],{},"null",". Strings, negative numbers, decimals, ",[295,355,356],{},"NaN"," or values beyond the safe integer range from the parent count as empty.",[319,359,361],{"id":360},"narrow-containers","Narrow containers",[292,363,364],{},"When the container is too narrow for both the years and months inputs, it switches to a single \"total months\" input; with enough width it goes back to both inputs, keeping any input not yet committed.",[334,366],{"name":367},"months-compact",[319,369,371],{"id":370},"variants","Variants",[292,373,374,375,302,378,381,382,385],{},"Uses the ",[295,376,377],{},"color",[295,379,380],{},"highlight"," of ",[295,383,384],{},"UInput",", applied to every input.",[334,387],{"name":388},"months-color",[319,390,392],{"id":391},"size-and-states","Size and states",[292,394,395,396,399],{},"While loading, a spinner shows after the months unit and input is disabled. The year and month units switch with the locale (\"yr\" and \"mo\" in English, \"年\" and \"月\" in Traditional Chinese); their width follows the text, and so does the width needed for the full years and months layout. See ",[308,397,102],{"href":398},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[334,401],{"name":402},"months-states",[314,404,406],{"id":405},"examples","Examples",[319,408,410],{"id":409},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[292,412,413,414,417,418,302,421,424],{},"Bind the total months, use ",[295,415,416],{},"requiredNumber"," for a required field, and check bounds separately with ",[295,419,420],{},"v.minValue",[295,422,423],{},"v.maxValue",".",[334,426],{"name":427},"months-validation",[319,429,431],{"id":430},"binding-only-years-a